=== list-map-pair-destructure
from: Red 0.2.5 lib/Red/Column.rakumod:72
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method map
--- code
my %h = b => 2, a => 1, c => 3;
for %h.pairs.sort.map(-> (:$key, :$value) { "$key:$value" }) { .say }
