=== list-map-key-value-pairs
from: DSL::Shared 0.2.11 lib/DSL/Shared/Entity/ResourceAccess.rakumod:18
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method map
--- code
my %files = a => 'x.csv', b => 'y.csv';
my @resources = %files.sort;
@resources = @resources.map({ $_.key => $_.value.uc });
say @resources.map(*.value).join(' ');
say @resources[0].^name;
--- expect
X.CSV Y.CSV
Pair

=== list-map-whatever-index
from: Getopt::Long 0.4.2 lib/Getopt/Long.rakumod:759
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method map
--- code
my @pairs = ('verbose', 'be loud'), ('n', 'count');
my $width = max(@pairs.map(*.[0].chars));
say $width;
say @pairs.map({ .[0].fmt("%-{$width}s") ~ '|' }).join("\n");
--- expect
7
verbose|
n      |

