=== list-grep-pair-and-not-pair
from: Inline::Perl5 0.62 lib/Inline/Perl5.pm6:1269
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method grep
--- code
my @args = 1, a => 2, 'x', b => 3;
say @args.grep({$_ !~~ Pair}).list;
my %named = @args.grep(Pair).hash;
say %named.sort;
--- expect
(1 x)
(a => 2 b => 3)

