=== list-grep-k-indices
from: Prettier::Table 1.1.3 lib/Prettier/Table.rakumod:1495
license: MIT
feature: method grep
--- code
my @field-names = <City Area Population>;
my $sort-by = 'Area';
my $sort-index = @field-names.grep({ $_ eq $sort-by }, :k).first;
